OL,3,CRussia kills at least seven after
OL,4,Cmassive strikes across Ukraine
OL,6,FMajor Russian attacks across Ukraine
OL,7,Fovernight killed at least eight people
OL,8,Fand injured dozens of others.
OL,10,FThe attacks were the latest in a
OL,11,Fseries of large-scale Russian strikes
OL,12,Fon Ukrainian cities that Russia has
OL,13,Fintensified over the summer, now
OL,14,Foccurring on a nearly weekly basis.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
