CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785496710
OL,3,CRussia kills at least seven after
OL,4,Cmassive strikes across Ukraine
OL,6,FUkraine's President Volodymyr
OL,7,FZelenskyy said Kyiv and the
OL,8,Fsurrounding region, along with the
OL,9,FDnipro, Lviv, Poltava, Kharkiv,
OL,10,FMykolaiv, Sumy, Vinnytsia, Cherkasy
OL,11,Fand Ivano-Frankivsk regions, were
OL,12,Fattacked overnight, with dozens of
OL,13,Fhomes, businesses and infrastructure
OL,14,Ffacilities destroyed or damaged.
OL,16,FHe said Russia used more than 70
OL,17,Fmissiles in the strike, along with
OL,18,Fmore than 280 attack drones, of which
OL,19,Fmore than 260 were intercepted.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
