CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785496710
OL,3,CRussia kills at least seven after
OL,4,Cmassive strikes across Ukraine
OL,6,F"Given the critical shortage of air
OL,7,Fdefence missiles from our partners,
OL,8,Four warriors are accomplishing truly
OL,9,Fincredible things, demonstrating a
OL,10,Fvery high level of professionalism,"
OL,11,Fhe said.
OL,13,F"This Russian terror once again proves
OL,14,Fthat protection against the Russian
OL,15,Fmissile threat is the most important
OL,16,Ftask when it comes to saving the lives
OL,17,Fof our people."
