OL,3,CRussia kills at least seven after
OL,4,Cmassive strikes across Ukraine
OL,6,FIn the Dnipropetrovsk region, Russian
OL,7,Fforces carried out a mass attack that
OL,8,Fkilled six people and injured ten,
OL,9,Fsaid Oleksandr Hanzha, head of the
OL,10,Fregional military administration.
OL,12,FA six-year-old girl and two boys aged
OL,13,F11 and 17 were killed in the attacks
OL,14,Fin the Kryvyi Rih area.
OL,16,FIn a post on X, Zelenskyy said the
OL,17,Fparents of the children were killed as
OL,18,Fwell in the same attack, and that two
OL,19,Fmore children were pulled alive from
OL,20,Funder the rubble.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
