CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1785496710
OL,3,CRussia kills at least seven after
OL,4,Cmassive strikes across Ukraine
OL,6,F"It was an ordinary home, blown into
OL,7,Fsmithereens by a ballistic missile,"
OL,8,Fhe said.
OL,10,FIn the Poltava region, next to the
OL,11,FDnipropetrovsk region in the west, a
OL,12,Fdrone strike hit warehouses, killing
OL,13,Fone person, regional head Vitalii
OL,14,FDiakivnych said.
OL,16,FIn Lviv, more than 20 residential
OL,17,Fbuildings were damaged, along with a
OL,18,Fschool and two kindergartens, with
OL,19,Fchildren among the injured, including
OL,20,Fone who was hospitalised.
