OL,3,CRussia kills at least seven after
OL,4,Cmassive strikes across Ukraine
OL,6,FIn Kyiv, Russian forces struck the
OL,7,Fcapital with ballistic missiles,
OL,8,Fkilling a 31-year-old man and injuring
OL,9,Ftwo others, the National Police press
OL,10,Fservice said.
OL,12,FIn the Kyiv region, five people were
OL,13,Finjured in the Brovary district,
OL,14,Fincluding a minor and two women,
OL,15,Facting regional administration head
OL,16,FRuslan Oliinyk said on Facebook.
