OL,3,CRussia kills at least seven after
OL,4,Cmassive strikes across Ukraine
OL,6,FIn Moscow, the Defence Ministry said
OL,7,Fthe Russian armed forces launched a
OL,8,Fmassive overnight strikes on air
OL,9,Fbases, arms factories and military
OL,10,Ftelecommunications and logistics
OL,11,Ffacilities in Kyiv, Lviv and in the
OL,12,FIvano-Frankivsk, Zhytomyr, Rivne,
OL,13,FVinnytsia and Dnipropetrovsk regions.
OL,15,FIt said the military also hit a ship
OL,16,Fin the Pivdennyi port and two ships
OL,17,Feast and south of Odesa.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
