OL,3,CRussia kills at least seven after
OL,4,Cmassive strikes across Ukraine
OL,6,FRussia's Defence Ministry said that
OL,7,Fair defences downed 258 Ukrainian
OL,8,Fdrones overnight. Penza Governor Oleg
OL,9,FMelnichenko said a depot belonging to
OL,10,Fthe Wildberries online retailer was
OL,11,Fset ablaze. He said one person was
OL,12,Finjured and 200 workers were evacuated.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
